o</strong>\r\nSensor &amp; Telecontrol System Lab</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit\">General Administration</span></h2>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><em>Coordinators</em></strong></h3>\r\n<table border=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr valign=\"top\">\r\n<td id=\"\" dir=\"\" scope=\"\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-954\" src=\"http://web06.opencloud.dssdi.ugm.ac.id/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2018/02/SUKINI-243x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"134\" height=\"165\" />\r\n\r\n<strong>Sukini, S.Kom.</strong>\r\nCoordinator of\r\nAcademics, Students\r\nand Alumnae Affairs</td>\r\n<td dir=\"\" scope=\"\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-967\" src=\"http://web06.opencloud.dssdi.ugm.ac.id/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2018/02/ANDI-1-273x300.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"147\" height=\"162\" />\r\n\r\n<strong>Andi Sudarmanto, S.Sos.</strong>\r\nCoordinator of\r\nGeneral Administration,\r\nHuman Resources;\r\nResearch and Social Services;\r\nand Network Affairs</td>\r\n<td dir=\"\" scope=\"\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-948\" src=\"http://web06.opencloud.dssdi.ugm.ac.id/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2018/02/JOHAN-285x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"151\" height=\"159\" />\r\n\r\n<strong>Johan Purwanto, S.Sos.</strong>\r\nCoordinator of\r\nAsset; Maintenance;\r\nSafety-Health-Environment (SHE);\r\nand Information and Communication\r\nTechnology (ICT) Affairs</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr valign=\"top\">\r\n<td dir=\"\" scope=\"\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\"></td>\r\n<td dir=\"\" scope=\"\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center\"><em><strong>Staff</strong></em></h3>\r\n<table border=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr valign=\"top\">\r\n<td id=\"\" dir=\"\" scope=\"\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-964\" src=\"http: